    "updated_at": "2023-09-06T09:30:28Z",
    "body": "Why should an implementer of an HTML parser be forced to track changes to e.g. user interaction or web workers that are completely irrelevant to HTML parsing?\r\n\r\nI don't see any arbitrariness problem with file-based boundaries.",
