    "updated_at": "2023-09-06T11:16:32Z",
    "body": "As far as tracking changes goes: in theory any normative change has a corresponding web-platform-tests PR as well as bugs filed against implementers. Tracking changes to parser tests thus ought to be sufficient (and if any are made, it would be prudent to have a look at the specification to see if it still makes sense to you).",
